Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||11-24-2001||03:01 AM||||Here's my top 5, or so, list:<P>1. I like white 85-87 GTs and 84 Indy Fieros.  The white exterior with the grey effects is a clean, powerful look. <P>2. Monochrome 88 GTs with gold rims: a) Bright Red, b) Medium Red Metallic, c) I've never seen a yellow GT with gold rims, d) black, e) white.<P>3. 87 blue: a) coupes, b) GTs and c) SEs.<P>4. Yellow 88 Formulas.<P>5. Black Fieros: a) 86-87 SEs, b) 84-85 all models.<P>KV||||reg||5
