Z||000015||SKIDMARK||11-24-2001||03:41 PM||||Top 5:<P>1. Black with tan interior (my prejudice)<BR>2. Burgundy/silver on a GT<BR>3. Yellow on a Formula<BR>4. White Indy<BR>5. Silver on a GT (don't see many around here).<P>Black is tough to keep clean, hard to maintain, shows all the defects, and looks the best in my opinion...at least when it's done right. <P>------------------<BR>White '85 4cyl coupe<BR>Black '86 v-6 SE<BR>'81 CB900F Super Sport||||reg||1
